00:02:08.880 --> 00:02:12.480
right off the bat we have a bit of controversy&nbsp;
regarding sitting bull's birthplace as there's&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:12.480 --> 00:02:17.520
some disagreement between the official version and&nbsp;
the information passed down through oral tradition&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:17.520 --> 00:02:23.440
according to the history books sitting bull was&nbsp;
born circa 1831 in modern-day south dakota on&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:23.440 --> 00:02:27.760
the bank of the grand river however some of&nbsp;
his descendants assert that the tribal leader&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:27.760 --> 00:02:32.560
was actually born in montana near modern-day&nbsp;
