00:02:32.560 --> 00:02:38.160
sitting bull was part of the hunk papa lakota&nbsp;
tribe themselves a subdivision of the sioux people&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:38.160 --> 00:02:43.120
his name in the lakota language was tatanka&nbsp;
leotarko which literally translates as&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:43.120 --> 00:02:48.720
buffalo bull who sits down but that was not the&nbsp;
name that he had as a child when he was born he&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:48.720 --> 00:02:53.360
was given the name jumping badger and later&nbsp;
acquired the nickname slow for his restrained&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:53.360 --> 00:02:57.840
and calculated demeanor his father and his uncles&nbsp;
