00:03:23.040 --> 00:03:28.320
badger was given his first opportunity to count&nbsp;
coup this meant striking an enemy up close and was&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:28.320 --> 00:03:32.960
the most common way of gaining war honours among&nbsp;
